WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Discover presents one five-sense reset with duration, cost, energy, Save, and Skip controls.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
The activity detail view expands into three practical steps and a Save for later action.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
